An empty description body is written with the empty sentinel

```
:: t
: {empty}

flush
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd></dd>
</dl>
<p>flush</p>
```

```
:: t
: {empty}
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd></dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: t
: {empty}
flush
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd></dd>
</dl>
<p>flush</p>
```

```
:: t1
: {empty}
:: t2
: d2
.
<dl>
  <dt>t1</dt>
  <dd></dd>
  <dt>t2</dt>
  <dd>d2</dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: t1
: {empty}
:: t2
: {empty}
.
<dl>
  <dt>t1</dt>
  <dd></dd>
  <dt>t2</dt>
  <dd></dd>
</dl>
```
